<p>Hi <%= @ticket.customer.display_name %>,</p>
<p>We've closed your request "<%= @ticket.subject %>". How did we do?</p>
<p>
  <%= link_to "👍 Good", new_portal_ticket_rating_url(@ticket.portal_token, rating: "good") %>
  &nbsp;&nbsp;
  <%= link_to "👎 Not so good", new_portal_ticket_rating_url(@ticket.portal_token, rating: "bad") %>
</p>
<p>If you still need help, just reply to this email and we'll reopen it.</p>
